# Shared material library for every scev OBJ block model.
#
# The diffuse colour map uses the `#texture` slot reference. Each block's
# generated JSON model binds its own PNG to that slot, so all seven OBJs
# share this single MTL file while drawing their own texture.
#
# Rationale: NeoForge's ObjModel silently drops every face whose mesh has no
# material attached (ObjModel.java line 541-543 — `if (mat == null) return;`).
# Stripping `mtllib`/`usemtl` during preprocessing makes the block render as
# invisible geometry. Giving each face a named material with a `#slot`
# reference is the fix. See docs/GOTCHAS.md for the full story.
newmtl main
map_Kd #texture
